/// owner, ColorlessCardPool.GetUnlockedCards(...), 3, Rng.CombatCardGeneration)`
/// — a whole-pool `UnstableShuffle` over the **FULL** ColorlessCardPool
/// combat pool (~50 cards), NOT the smaller "colorless modifier" subset the
/// Python pin used. Then `if (IsUpgraded) CardCmd.Upgrade(cards)` upgrades all
/// 3, `FromChooseACardScreen(canSkip: true)` opens the single-pick skippable
/// choose-a-card screen, and the chosen card is added to Hand via
